    "requirement": "Requirements — Chief Audit Executive\n     Provide the board and senior management with information needed to support and\n         promote recognition of internal audit throughout the organization.\n     Coordinate internal audit’s board communications with senior management to support the\n         board in fulfilling its responsibilities.\nEssential Conditions — Board\n     Champion internal audit’s purpose, strategy, and objectives.\n     Work with senior management to enable unrestricted access to information, records,\n         personnel, and physical property necessary to fulfill the mandate.\n     Support the chief audit executive through regular, direct communication.\n     Establish reporting at an organizational level that enables fulfillment of the mandate.\n     Approve the internal audit charter, audit plan, budget, and resource plan.\n     Inquire about restrictions on scope, access, authority, or resources that could limit\n         effectiveness.\n     Meet periodically with the chief audit executive without senior management present.\nEssential Conditions — Senior Management\n     Support recognition of the internal audit function throughout the organization.",
