    "requirement": "Requirements\nThe CAE must develop and implement an internal audit strategy that:\n     Supports the organization’s strategic objectives and success.\n     Aligns with the expectations of the board, senior management, and other key\n         stakeholders.\n     Guides the internal audit function toward fulfillment of its mandate.\nThe strategy must include:\n     A vision for the internal audit function.\n     Strategic objectives.\n     Supporting initiatives.\nThe CAE must periodically review the strategy with the board and senior management.",
