    "requirement": "Requirements\nThe CAE must manage the internal audit function’s financial resources.\nThe CAE must develop a budget that supports:\n     Successful implementation of the internal audit strategy.\n     Achievement of the internal audit plan.\n     Resources needed for the function’s operation.\n     Training.\n     Acquisition of technology and tools.\nThe CAE must manage day-to-day activities effectively and efficiently in alignment with the\nbudget.\nThe CAE must seek budget approval from the board and promptly communicate the impact of\ninsufficient financial resources to the board and senior management.",
