    "requirement": "Requirements\nThe CAE must communicate unacceptable levels of risk.\nWhen the CAE concludes that management has accepted risk exceeding the organization’s risk\nappetite or risk tolerance:\n    1. The matter must be discussed with senior management.\n    2. If the CAE determines that senior management has not resolved it, the matter must be\n         escalated to the board.\nThe CAE is not responsible for resolving the risk.",
